msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "遥控输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixSurveyA1.rst:288
#: 9d3d5812029a40eca7b8c525eca74b90
msgid ""
"The PPM/SBus.in pin, which by default is mapped to a timer input, can be "
"used for all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and "
"SRXL2 which require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected "
"in this manner, will only provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"PPM/SBus.in 引脚默认映射为定时器输入，可用于 ArduPilot 支持的所有接收机协议，但 CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 "
"除外，这两种协议需要真正的 UART 连接。但以这种方式连接时，FPort 仅提供 RC 信号而无数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixSurveyA1.rst:290
#: dd1e0c4843f84e32b1e19bbb2adb2291
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, a full UART, such as SERIAL4 (UART8) would need to be used for "
"receiver connections. Below are setups using UART4. "
":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` should be set to \"23\"."
msgstr ""
"若要启用 Fport、CRSF 和 SRXL2 接收机中的 CRSF 和嵌入式数传，需使用完整 UART（如 SERIAL4 即 "
"UART8）进行接收机连接。以下为使用 UART4 的配置。:ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` 应设置为"
" 「23」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixSurveyA1.rst:292
#: 371fedada9f64aa1aec02e39bf18dfc4
msgid ""
"FPort would require :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` be set to "
"\"15\"."
msgstr "FPort 需将 :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「15」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixSurveyA1.rst:294
#: a25a5ad8f0b74a88911fb35313ed7198
msgid ""
"CRSF would require :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` be set to \"0\"."
msgstr "CRSF 需将 :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixSurveyA1.rst:296
#: 70498ab58b8443acae7ee00b0b584b51
msgid ""
"SRXL2 would require :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` be set to \"4\" "
"and connects only the UART4 TX pin."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需将 :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「4」，且仅连接 UART4 TX 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixSurveyA1.rst:298
#: b17d49dd12694c55a9f4ada0a2c9b612
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 中，任何 UART 都可用于 RC 系统连接，并兼容除 PPM 外的所有协议。详情请参阅 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixSurveyA1.rst:301
#: b650a7fe126440c8b3a4daf1e6cad9a3
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixSurveyA1.rst:303
#: be93dde344e0491d8c23fd9be328e6cd
msgid ""
"The PixSurveyA1 supports up to 14 PWM outputs. All 14 outputs support all "
"normal PWM output formats. All FMU outputs (9-14) support DShot."
msgstr ""
"PixSurveyA1 支持最多 14 路 PWM 输出。全部 14 路输出均支持所有标准 PWM 输出格式，所有 FMU 输出（9-14）均支持 "
"DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixSurveyA1.rst:306
#: a01df83aea2c4608ae097d6bf770bcf9
msgid "The 6 FMU outputs are in 4 groups:"
msgstr "6 路 FMU 输出分为 4 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixSurveyA1.rst:308
#: 77c9827d8d96446a86dbc885ee28fb36
msgid "Outputs 9, 10, 11 and 12 in group1"
msgstr "输出 9、10、11 和 12 在第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixSurveyA1.rst:309
#: c6dfb0c5ec1e43978a2461f874c45dcd
msgid "Outputs 13 and 14 in group2"
msgstr "输出 13 和 14 在第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-makeflyeasy-PixSurveyA1.rst:313
#: 4d008ad1a5a64c58a8a5d6c9a6e400e2
msgid ""
"FMU outputs within the same group need to use the same output rate and "
"protocol. If any output in a group uses DShot then all channels in that "
"group need to use DShot."
msgstr "同一组内的 FMU 输出需使用相同的输出频率和协议。若某组内任一输出使用 DShot，则该组所有通道均需使用 DShot。"

